# Available GC Modes:
# 0 - Disabled
# 1 - Active (default)
# 4 - Collect every cycle (testing only)
# 8 - Reserved (not in use)
# In theory modes can be combined (n/a now)

# Disable GC
Programa xestión-memoria: 0.

# request GC mode setting to confirm
Saída escribir: Programa gcmode, salto-de-liña.
